# Hostnames whose failure is already known and accepted. They still appear in
# every run's summary; they simply stop setting the "needs attention" exit code,
# so a scheduled run stays silent until something NEW goes wrong.
#
# Acknowledge a device only after the problem has been raised with whoever can
# fix it. This file is a record of "we know, it is being handled" — not a place
# to hide findings.
#
# Copy to acknowledged.txt and edit.

